<p>You have mastered your draconic nature.</p><p>You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">16%, 26%, 34%, 39%, 44%</acronym> knockback resistance, and your blindness and stun resistances are increased by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">8%, 13%, 16%, 19%, 21%.</acronym></p>